(7531043, 1204124, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very appealing cul-de-sac, or T-intersection, in the old part of the city.  The soft colors and advancing light are an enticing prelude to the day.  The abrupt end of the leading lines bounces the eye back to the foreground again.  It seems the modern world has only lightly brushed its patina on this scene.  I also like the pizza in the sky --  blue cheese.<br/>One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Very appealing cul-de-sac, or T-intersection, in the old part of the city.  The soft colors and advancing light are an enticing prelude to the day.  The abrupt end of the leading lines bounces the eye back to the foreground again.  It seems the modern world has only lightly brushed its patina on this scene.  I also like the pizza in the sky --  blue cheese.One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-26 13:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531044, 1204177, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exhilarating image of morning in the wilderness.  Deeply invokes the senses --   light, sound, aroma and temperature.  The highlighted bank of rocks on the left are like a exclamation point.<br/>One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Exhilarating image of morning in the wilderness.  Deeply invokes the senses --   light, sound, aroma and temperature.  The highlighted bank of rocks on the left are like a exclamation point.One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-26 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531046, 1204251, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming view of a charming house on, okay, a charming hill.  It''s the upward track that brings the scene together, drawing the eye to the horizon and the morning.  The hillside is attractively dappled with greens and browns, the modest sky is in keeping with the overall tenor of the image.<br/>One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Charming view of a charming house on, okay, a charming hill.  It''s the upward track that brings the scene together, drawing the eye to the horizon and the morning.  The hillside is attractively dappled with greens and browns, the modest sky is in keeping with the overall tenor of the image.One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-26 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531052, 1204319, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The differentiated focus is beautifully handled.  The oncoming bee is presented in likewise muted fashion, adding to the feeling of waking up from a dream.</td>', 'Excellent.  The differentiated focus is beautifully handled.  The oncoming bee is presented in likewise muted fashion, adding to the feeling of waking up from a dream.', '2017-08-26 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531053, 1204136, 173844, '<td valign="top">Striking use of color, lines and form in service of spacial definition and immensity.  The figures are very well placed.  And morning breaks lovely in the east.  Fine image.</td>', 'Striking use of color, lines and form in service of spacial definition and immensity.  The figures are very well placed.  And morning breaks lovely in the east.  Fine image.', '2017-08-26 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531054, 1204323, 173844, '<td valign="top">That central line of fog bestows an interesting semi-symmetry to this peaceful image.  Very nice colors.  Both delicate and massive.  Enjoyable.</td>', 'That central line of fog bestows an interesting semi-symmetry to this peaceful image.  Very nice colors.  Both delicate and massive.  Enjoyable.', '2017-08-26 16:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531055, 1204159, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s stuff going on here just at the edge of consciousness, which lends a mysterious befuddlement to this photo.  Like trying to grasp a dream that''s rapidly fleeing.  I like the way it looks, abstract and striped with light.</td>', 'There''s stuff going on here just at the edge of consciousness, which lends a mysterious befuddlement to this photo.  Like trying to grasp a dream that''s rapidly fleeing.  I like the way it looks, abstract and striped with light.', '2017-08-26 16:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531057, 1204350, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunrise.  This side of the hills still rests in inky darkness, but the unusual white buildings become highlighted, like Mayan ruins in the jungle.  It''s a privilege to be present.</td>', 'Very nice sunrise.  This side of the hills still rests in inky darkness, but the unusual white buildings become highlighted, like Mayan ruins in the jungle.  It''s a privilege to be present.', '2017-08-26 16:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531058, 1204252, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely intimate scene with the couple being softly backlit by the rising sun.  Clean and airy.  Calmly ebullient.</td>', 'Lovely intimate scene with the couple being softly backlit by the rising sun.  Clean and airy.  Calmly ebullient.', '2017-08-26 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531059, 1204258, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome procession.  Could they all be transfixed by the passing magpie or is there something more sinister afoot?  Electric moment, beautifully captured.</td>', 'Handsome procession.  Could they all be transfixed by the passing magpie or is there something more sinister afoot?  Electric moment, beautifully captured.', '2017-08-26 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531060, 1204025, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of volume as the sun translates the windows into lengthy images on the floor, maybe the dancing mentioned in the title. Cheerful image.</td>', 'Good feeling of volume as the sun translates the windows into lengthy images on the floor, maybe the dancing mentioned in the title. Cheerful image.', '2017-08-26 16:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531061, 1204333, 173844, '<td valign="top">The softness of the grasses is very appealing.</td>', 'The softness of the grasses is very appealing.', '2017-08-26 16:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531064, 1204183, 173844, '<td valign="top">An explosive dawn and nice composition.  Strangely, I''m not put off by the wires crossing the sky.  A strong image.</td>', 'An explosive dawn and nice composition.  Strangely, I''m not put off by the wires crossing the sky.  A strong image.', '2017-08-26 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531065, 1204250, 173844, '<td valign="top">So very peaceful, a perfect bucolic scene.  The colors are lovely and the sun is modestly peeking from behind the tree to the side.  Looks like all''s right with the world.</td>', 'So very peaceful, a perfect bucolic scene.  The colors are lovely and the sun is modestly peeking from behind the tree to the side.  Looks like all''s right with the world.', '2017-08-26 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531095, 1204270, 150202, '<td valign="top">A tad too dark in the shadows for my liking. Pretty flowers.</td>', 'A tad too dark in the shadows for my liking. Pretty flowers.', '2017-08-27 01:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531096, 1204325, 150202, '<td valign="top">Most of the flower seems a tad out of focus, which being the only subject, doesn''t draw me in. The lighting is nice.</td>', 'Most of the flower seems a tad out of focus, which being the only subject, doesn''t draw me in. The lighting is nice.', '2017-08-27 01:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531117, 1204252, 185714, '<td valign="top">Lovely arrangment! Beautiful natural lighting penetrating through the window.  Love it, though I feel that there is portion of lost details on the flooring.</td>', 'Lovely arrangment! Beautiful natural lighting penetrating through the window.  Love it, though I feel that there is portion of lost details on the flooring.', '2017-08-27 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531118, 1204330, 185714, '<td valign="top">interesting capture</td>', 'interesting capture', '2017-08-27 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531132, 1204307, 173844, '<td valign="top">And a pretty intermingling of blue and pink it is.  The posts are nicely aligned along the horizon.  Both soothing and refreshing.</td>', 'And a pretty intermingling of blue and pink it is.  The posts are nicely aligned along the horizon.  Both soothing and refreshing.', '2017-08-27 11:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531134, 1204332, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though I often find modernity in landscapes to be intrusive, here this collection gives solidity to the handsome background by establishing a sense of purpose, of people actually on the ground.  This is awkwardly expressed, but there it is.  Taking the image from well in back of the vehicles further allows a sense of gainful occupation.  The oncoming light is rather beautiful.</td>', 'Though I often find modernity in landscapes to be intrusive, here this collection gives solidity to the handsome background by establishing a sense of purpose, of people actually on the ground.  This is awkwardly expressed, but there it is.  Taking the image from well in back of the vehicles further allows a sense of gainful occupation.  The oncoming light is rather beautiful.', '2017-08-27 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531135, 1204341, 173844, '<td valign="top">The fresh light of morning on this butterfly -- as I assume it is  -- makes a marvelous highlight against tangled undergrowth.  It''s a beacon, an arrow, a Cheshire smile.  Goes to show that there''s no end of wonders to be seen.  Glad you''ve shared this one.</td>', 'The fresh light of morning on this butterfly -- as I assume it is  -- makes a marvelous highlight against tangled undergrowth.  It''s a beacon, an arrow, a Cheshire smile.  Goes to show that there''s no end of wonders to be seen.  Glad you''ve shared this one.', '2017-08-27 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531137, 1203886, 173844, '<td valign="top">As an exemplar of this type of seascape, this image ticks off all the boxes.  Very nice.  I especially like the tiny birds by surf''s edge.</td>', 'As an exemplar of this type of seascape, this image ticks off all the boxes.  Very nice.  I especially like the tiny birds by surf''s edge.', '2017-08-27 12:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531139, 1204284, 173844, '<td valign="top">I very much like this inverted black and white, this elaborate silhouette.  The sign which retains its color does not enhance the beauty of the image, in my opinion.  On a nitpicking note, swans, not ducks.</td>', 'I very much like this inverted black and white, this elaborate silhouette.  The sign which retains its color does not enhance the beauty of the image, in my opinion.  On a nitpicking note, swans, not ducks.', '2017-08-27 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
