(7531146, 1204255, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice early morning image.  I like how the water is dappled with both reflections and boats.</td>', 'Nice early morning image.  I like how the water is dappled with both reflections and boats.', '2017-08-27 13:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
